+
+- **Quality and timeliness (Act 8).** The one Founder-defined productive objective sampled this cycle — `@ottojung` to #1 by site-credited steps — has produced **zero** credited steps after ~26 h while the leader has 102. Activity (live researchers, staffing cycles, staged repairs, a publication test branch and PR) is abundant but is a leading indicator only. This is the clearest available evidence that agent activity and process output are not delivery.
